your and monster's levels. Somone else might answer this better.

The chance to not just scare but also destroy or make peaceful (for 
chaotics) is based on the monster's type. They may suffer this effect if 
your level is at least the number on the corresponding line in the table 
below.
lich    16
ghost   14
vampire 12
wraith  10
mummie   8
zombie   6

Range of the #turn command is also dependent on your level, (5 + lvl/5) 
if I read the source right.

You can only (try to) turn demonic monsters if you are level 16 or 
higher.

All of above is based on my limited understanding of the source. It 
seems there is no spoiler around for the #turn command.

